$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=vebklem4  LOC_AFTER=?

* Lemma for vebkz (greedy assignment): for K processed positions there is an assignment g : ( 1 ... K ) --> roots of unity and g residual set r of at most ( 1 - 1 / E ) ^ K # S characters of S, every other character of S agreeing with g at some position.

